/target

# Transient artifacts produced by the cargo-test suite when run from
# the crate root.  Tracked golden/seed fixtures (e.g. log_test.txt,
# session_resume_test.bin) are committed under their own explicit
# names and are not matched by the patterns below.
*.client.log
ech_config.txt
error_reason_log.txt
pacing_rate.csv
quality_update.csv
random_padding_log.txt
random_padding_tickets.bin
retry_tests_tokens.bin
stress_ticket_*.bin
test_keylog_client.txt
test_keylog_server.txt
